WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.260 --> 00:00:02.020
Hi, Mystery Recapped here.

00:00:02.020 --> 00:00:06.059
Today I’m going to explain a science fiction
thriller film called “Freaks.”

00:00:06.059 --> 00:00:07.490
Spoilers ahead!

00:00:07.490 --> 00:00:08.856
Watch out and take care!

00:00:13.210 --> 00:00:17.130
Seven-year-old Chloe has never been out of
an abandoned house; she lives with her father,

00:00:17.130 --> 00:00:19.220
Henry; her mother died years ago.

00:00:19.220 --> 00:00:23.114
The movie starts as we see Chloe eyeing an
ice cream van outside her house through a hole.

00:00:23.980 --> 00:00:26.630
There are some strange things outside Chloe's
house.

00:00:26.630 --> 00:00:30.060
We see that the birds outside are not moving
and appear to be glitching.

00:00:30.060 --> 00:00:33.960
The electricity in the house is always out,
and there seems to be no life outside the house.

00:00:34.839 --> 00:00:38.780
Henry always gets furious when she peeks outside;
she is forbidden to leave the house in fear

00:00:38.780 --> 00:00:40.889
of the bad men who killed her mother.

00:00:40.889 --> 00:00:42.539
Henry is unsure of his safety.

00:00:42.539 --> 00:00:46.429
So, he has prepared a plan in case something
bad happens to him.

00:00:46.429 --> 00:00:49.449
He has made a deal with their neighbour, the
Reeds family.

00:00:49.449 --> 00:00:53.149
In case of his absence, the Reeds will be
paid a steady amount of cash as long as they

00:00:53.149 --> 00:00:54.799
take care of his daughter.

00:00:54.799 --> 00:01:00.100
The family consists of a daughter named Harper,
a mother named Nancy, and a father named Steve.

00:01:00.100 --> 00:01:03.760
One day, as the two play poker, Henry’s
eyes start to bleed.

00:01:03.760 --> 00:01:07.350
That night while sleeping, Chloe heard a strange
noise from her closet.

00:01:07.350 --> 00:01:11.610
She opens it to check, when suddenly, a woman
inside the closet screams.

00:01:11.610 --> 00:01:13.320
Chloe too yells in fear.

00:01:13.320 --> 00:01:17.894
She runs back to her bed, and starts to scribble
on the wall, repeating the words, “go away ghost"

00:01:18.498 --> 00:01:21.088
Finally the screaming stops, and the ghost
is gone.

00:01:21.420 --> 00:01:25.500
The following morning, Chloe wakes up to the
sound of an ice-cream truck, and peaks through

00:01:25.500 --> 00:01:26.500
a window.

00:01:26.500 --> 00:01:29.530
Her neighbor’s daughter, Harper, is buying
ice cream.

00:01:29.530 --> 00:01:33.150
She whispers to Harper to bring it to her,
knowing that she won’t hear it.

00:01:33.150 --> 00:01:36.090
However, soon after, someone knocks on the
doors.

00:01:36.090 --> 00:01:38.590
Chloe rushes downstairs and opens the door.

00:01:38.590 --> 00:01:42.040
Surprisingly, it is Harper, offering her the
ice cream.

00:01:42.040 --> 00:01:45.380
Just as she is about to grab it, Henry from
behind her stops her.

00:01:45.380 --> 00:01:50.190
Surprisingly again, Harper calls Chloe by
her name, Henry is confused, as he has never

00:01:50.190 --> 00:01:54.159
introduced Chloe to anyone, so he quickly
brings her inside.

00:01:54.159 --> 00:01:58.150
Henry is furious and asks her if she had met
Harper before, but Chloe insists that she

00:01:58.150 --> 00:02:02.209
has never been out of the house, but he doesn’t
believe her and puts her into the closet as a punishment.

00:02:03.180 --> 00:02:07.610
The following morning, Henry comes into the
closet and apologizes to her, but she is still

00:02:07.610 --> 00:02:10.629
mad at him, and insists that she wants to
go out.

00:02:10.629 --> 00:02:14.579
Henry promises to bring her ice cream if she
never opens the door again.

00:02:14.579 --> 00:02:18.769
He then leaves for the grocery store, but
comes back injured with a gun in his hand.

00:02:18.769 --> 00:02:22.489
As he mends his injuries, Chloe looks for
ice cream in the basket he has brought, and

00:02:22.489 --> 00:02:24.040
finds no ice cream.

00:02:24.040 --> 00:02:28.200
She starts to yell at her father, but he passes
out because of the injury.

00:02:28.200 --> 00:02:31.019
Just then, Chloe hears the ice cream truck
ringing.

00:02:31.019 --> 00:02:33.939
She gets a hundred-dollar bill from the locker
and goes outside.

00:02:33.939 --> 00:02:37.549
The old man in the truck bribes her with an
ice cream cone, and persuades her to get inside

00:02:37.549 --> 00:02:38.680
the truck.

00:02:38.680 --> 00:02:42.430
She is doubtful, but gets in once he says
he will take her to the park.

00:02:42.430 --> 00:02:46.090
They drive away, and Chloe sees the outside
world for the first time.

00:02:46.090 --> 00:02:48.980
She sees a billboard of a person bleeding
from his eyes.

00:02:48.980 --> 00:02:52.940
Below the picture, it says to call 9-1-1 if
you see someone like that.

00:02:52.940 --> 00:02:55.510
Chloe mentions that the man bleeds like her
dad.

00:02:55.510 --> 00:02:59.629
The old man then asks her if she has ever
bled like that, but Chloe denies it.

00:02:59.629 --> 00:03:03.620
When they reach the park, the man sits Chloe
on a swing, and asks her if there is something

00:03:03.620 --> 00:03:05.689
she can do that other people cannot.

00:03:05.689 --> 00:03:08.140
But Chloe doesn’t answer, too busy playing.

00:03:08.140 --> 00:03:11.040
Suddenly, he starts to swing her aggressively.

00:03:11.040 --> 00:03:14.599
Chloe is scared and asks him to stop, but
the man tries to make her angry to surface

00:03:14.599 --> 00:03:15.890
her powers.

00:03:15.890 --> 00:03:20.549
Eventually, a policeman approaches them, and
asks him to step away from the girl.

00:03:20.549 --> 00:03:24.299
The old man claims that he is Chloe’s grandfather,
but Chloe denies it.

00:03:24.299 --> 00:03:27.110
The officer then asks Alan to show his eyes.

00:03:27.110 --> 00:03:30.319
Alan turns to Chloe and tells him that the
officer is one of the bad guys who killed

00:03:30.319 --> 00:03:31.450
her mother.

00:03:31.450 --> 00:03:34.579
Chloe becomes upset and starts screaming at
the man to go away.

00:03:34.579 --> 00:03:38.670
Surprisingly, it works; he goes away without
another word.

00:03:38.670 --> 00:03:42.980
It turns out that Chloe has telepathic abilities,
the ability to enter and manipulate other

00:03:42.980 --> 00:03:44.420
people's minds.

00:03:44.420 --> 00:03:49.190
The old man begins to realize that Chloe is
a special child and brings her back home.

00:03:49.190 --> 00:03:53.719
On their way, he tells Chloe about her mother,
Mary, and gives her a picture of her.

00:03:53.719 --> 00:03:57.230
He reveals that he is actually Chloe’s grandfather,
Alan.

00:03:57.230 --> 00:04:00.840
Before parting ways, he gives her a powder
and tells her to drug her dad when she hears

00:04:00.840 --> 00:04:02.609
the ice cream truck ring.

00:04:02.609 --> 00:04:06.040
This will make Henry fall asleep and Chloe
can go to the park.

00:04:06.040 --> 00:04:08.120
She takes the powder and goes inside.

00:04:08.120 --> 00:04:12.260
A few hours later, Henry wakes up and sees
Chloe in her room drawing.

00:04:12.260 --> 00:04:16.199
She accuses him of lying about the bad people
outside the house, and the two get into a fight.

00:04:16.711 --> 00:04:19.422
That night, she looks at Mary’s picture
and imagines her.

00:04:19.910 --> 00:04:22.890
Suddenly, the closet starts making noise again.

00:04:22.890 --> 00:04:26.350
Chloe goes in, and sees the ghost she had
seen a few days ago.

00:04:26.350 --> 00:04:29.560
But now, she recognizes her as her mother,
Mary.

00:04:29.560 --> 00:04:34.140
She introduces herself, but Mary pushes her
away saying that Chloe isn't real and just

00:04:34.140 --> 00:04:36.890
a hallucination, so Chloe runs out of the
closet.

00:04:36.890 --> 00:04:40.971
Turns out that Chloe also has a long-distance
telepathic ability, and could make other people

00:04:40.971 --> 00:04:43.170
at a distance see and talk to her.

00:04:43.170 --> 00:04:46.470
In the morning, the father is sleeping while
watching the news.

00:04:46.470 --> 00:04:48.670
Chloe silently listens to the news.

00:04:48.670 --> 00:04:53.030
From the news, Chloe finds out that they are
strange people, often called the Freaks.

00:04:53.030 --> 00:04:56.250
Freaks have super abilities causing their
eyes to bleed out when they use them.

00:04:56.250 --> 00:05:01.040
10 years ago, a freak messed up the city of
Dallas and killed thousands of people.

00:05:01.040 --> 00:05:04.760
Since then, the government has set up a defence
force against strange people called the ADF.

00:05:04.760 --> 00:05:09.790
The ADF arranges for all Freaks to be held
in an underground facility on Mount Madoc,

00:05:09.790 --> 00:05:13.350
and Freaks roaming the city are considered
illegal and could be killed immediately.

00:05:13.350 --> 00:05:18.200
An ADF agent named Agent Ray reveals her plan
to train the freaks on Mount Madoc to be used

00:05:18.200 --> 00:05:20.250
as weapons in battles.

00:05:20.250 --> 00:05:24.120
After hearing the news, Chloe is devastated;
she hopes that one day she will be adopted

00:05:24.120 --> 00:05:27.980
by the Reeds family, so that she can become
a normal family member and have a mother figure

00:05:27.980 --> 00:05:29.250
who loves her.

00:05:29.250 --> 00:05:33.690
Later, Chloe is playing with paper toys, wishing
that she lived with Harper.

00:05:33.690 --> 00:05:36.460
Just then, Harper and her friends arrive in
the room.

00:05:36.460 --> 00:05:39.860
Harper screams at Chloe, asking her why she
is in her room.

00:05:39.860 --> 00:05:43.330
The two seem to be in their respective room
but somehow have met each other because of

00:05:43.330 --> 00:05:44.370
Chloe’s power.

00:05:44.370 --> 00:05:47.390
Harper’s friends make fun of Chloe for not
having a mother.

00:05:47.390 --> 00:05:49.180
Chloe cries and screams.

00:05:49.180 --> 00:05:53.340
When she opens her eyes, Harper and her friends
are gone, and Mary appears in the closet.

00:05:53.340 --> 00:05:58.000
At first, her mother doesn’t believe it
is her daughter and thinks it is just a hallucination,

00:05:58.000 --> 00:06:02.370
but she begins to realize that Chloe has telepathic
powers and that it is really her.

00:06:02.370 --> 00:06:04.280
Chloe starts talking to her mother.

00:06:04.280 --> 00:06:08.650
It turns out that Chloe's mother, Mary, is
also a freak, and she is still alive and being

00:06:08.650 --> 00:06:13.300
held in Mount Madoc….but not long after,
her mother suddenly disappears again.

00:06:13.300 --> 00:06:17.440
The next morning, Chloe tells Henry about
her mother, but he doesn’t believe her.

00:06:17.440 --> 00:06:20.640
Seeing no other way to escape, she tries to
drug her father.

00:06:20.640 --> 00:06:24.000
Henry realizes what she’s doing, and chases
her to the door.

00:06:24.000 --> 00:06:27.320
She commands him to sleep and he slips down
to the floor as Chloe’s eye bleeds for the

00:06:27.320 --> 00:06:28.790
first time.

00:06:28.790 --> 00:06:32.010
She meets Alan in his truck and he tells her
about his plan.

00:06:32.010 --> 00:06:35.897
Alan explains that Chloe's mother is still
alive, but is being held captive on Mount Madoc.

00:06:36.760 --> 00:06:40.820
He plans to go to Mount Madoc, by meeting
an ADF agent, Ray.

00:06:40.820 --> 00:06:42.840
Alan takes Chloe to see agent Ray.

00:06:42.840 --> 00:06:46.990
He then makes up a story about him being a
priest and Chloe being his adopted daughter.

00:06:46.990 --> 00:06:49.940
He lies that he has just found out that Chloe
is a freak.

00:06:49.940 --> 00:06:53.230
He asks Agent Ray to protect Chloe and take
her to Mount Madoc.

00:06:53.230 --> 00:06:55.840
And Alan also wants to go there to accompany
Chloe.

00:06:55.840 --> 00:07:00.430
Then, Agent Ray checks for traces of blood
under Chloe's eyes to make sure she's a Freak.

00:07:00.430 --> 00:07:04.360
Ray also checks Alan's eyes, but finds no
traces under his.

00:07:04.360 --> 00:07:08.120
Being called a freak, Chloe gets offended
and yells that she is not a freak.

00:07:08.120 --> 00:07:11.210
Ray calls for backup, thinking that Chloe
is dangerous.

00:07:11.210 --> 00:07:15.320
Luckily, Alan and Chloe manage to escape by
suddenly disappearing.

00:07:15.320 --> 00:07:19.400
It turns out that Alan is also a Freak who
has the ability to become invisible.

00:07:19.400 --> 00:07:23.670
He has been using hydrogen peroxide to remove
the traces of blood under his eyes.

00:07:23.670 --> 00:07:27.740
The two flee from there; Chloe asks him to
take her back home, but he wants to take Chloe

00:07:27.740 --> 00:07:31.660
to his apartment to teach her how to use her
powers so they can help Chloe's mother.

00:07:31.660 --> 00:07:33.790
She uses her power to make him drive home.

00:07:33.790 --> 00:07:38.460
Suddenly, Henry appears on the road and he
takes Alan and his Truck and they just disappear.

00:07:38.460 --> 00:07:41.020
He takes Alan home and ties him to a chair.

00:07:41.020 --> 00:07:43.400
Moments later Henry returns to Chloe.

00:07:43.400 --> 00:07:45.840
He begins to explain everything to Chloe.

00:07:45.840 --> 00:07:48.760
It turns out that all this time Henry is also
a Freak.

00:07:48.760 --> 00:07:52.650
He has the ability to create a time bubble
that slows time in the outside world, while

00:07:52.650 --> 00:07:55.310
the person inside the bubble performs normally….

00:07:55.310 --> 00:07:58.740
All this time he had created a time bubble
around their house which worked as long as

00:07:58.740 --> 00:08:00.060
he wasn't asleep.

00:08:00.060 --> 00:08:04.050
. To the rest of the world, it had only been
a few months since Chloe's mother was arrested,

00:08:04.050 --> 00:08:07.430
but to the two of them, they had been hiding
in the house for seven years.

00:08:07.430 --> 00:08:11.250
Deciding it’s time to finally let Chloe
go, Henry takes her to the Reeds to fulfill

00:08:11.250 --> 00:08:12.460
their deal.

00:08:12.460 --> 00:08:15.770
Steven agrees and introduces them to Nancy
and Harper.

00:08:15.770 --> 00:08:19.850
Nancy soon realizes that Chloe is a Freak,
and backs out of the deal, saying that she

00:08:19.850 --> 00:08:22.340
didn’t know they were supposed to be taking
in a freak.

00:08:22.340 --> 00:08:26.710
Finally, they leave, while begging the Reeds
to not report them to the police.

00:08:26.710 --> 00:08:30.630
Back in the house, Henry is shocked to see
Chloe’s eyes bleeding, and realizes that

00:08:30.630 --> 00:08:32.789
she already has super abilities.

00:08:32.789 --> 00:08:35.330
Afraid to trust her, Henry puts her in the
closet.

00:08:35.330 --> 00:08:39.500
There, she meets her mother Mary who is being
held at Mount Madoc, but suddenly the prison

00:08:39.500 --> 00:08:41.530
guard drags Mary outside.

00:08:41.530 --> 00:08:44.670
When Chloe comes out of the closet, she tells
Henry about her mother.

00:08:44.670 --> 00:08:49.630
At first, Henry does not believe her, but
finally, Alan explains everything.

00:08:49.630 --> 00:08:53.870
It turns out that when he and Mary attacked
Mount Madoc, they lost, and Alan managed to

00:08:53.870 --> 00:08:58.200
escape, but Mary was captured; he thought
Mary was killed, but it turns out that Mary

00:08:58.200 --> 00:08:59.990
was only detained.

00:08:59.990 --> 00:09:03.240
Suddenly Chloe sees her neighbour Nancy reporting
them to the police.

00:09:03.240 --> 00:09:07.630
Chloe uses her telepathic powers to get a
vision of what Nancy is talking about.

00:09:07.630 --> 00:09:09.279
Nancy calls Chloe a Freak.

00:09:09.279 --> 00:09:12.810
Agitated, Chloe uses her power to influence
the policeman.

00:09:12.810 --> 00:09:14.510
He stabs Nancy's eye.

00:09:14.510 --> 00:09:19.640
Seeing her eyes bleeding, the ADF agents assume
Nancy is a freak, and shoot her right away.

00:09:19.640 --> 00:09:24.130
The Reeds family is eventually arrested by
the ADF, assuming they are all freaks.

00:09:24.130 --> 00:09:28.050
Henry is mad at Chloe for killing someone,
but Alan defends her and they fight.

00:09:28.050 --> 00:09:32.230
Chloe immediately goes to her room, where
she has a vision of Mary being captured.

00:09:32.230 --> 00:09:35.760
Henry and Alan then come, and Henry is shocked
to see his wife.

00:09:35.760 --> 00:09:38.280
Apparently, Mary will be put to death soon.

00:09:38.280 --> 00:09:42.860
Henry tries to shoot the doctor, but of course
he can’t, because it is just an illusion.

00:09:42.860 --> 00:09:47.400
Henry and Alan bid farewell to Mary, but suddenly
Chloe uses her telepathic powers to control

00:09:47.400 --> 00:09:50.700
the doctor's mind and uses the device to kill
himself.

00:09:50.700 --> 00:09:53.850
Chloe enters the mind of the other officer
to free her mother.

00:09:53.850 --> 00:09:55.760
Just then, the doorbell rings.

00:09:55.760 --> 00:09:57.150
It is Agent Ray.

00:09:57.150 --> 00:09:59.140
She has come to investigate them.

00:09:59.140 --> 00:10:02.790
Henry freezes the time and dresses up as a
realtor trying to sell the house.

00:10:02.790 --> 00:10:06.540
Alan gives him hydrogen peroxide to remove
the bloodstains from his face.

00:10:06.540 --> 00:10:09.589
He lets Ray in, and checks Henry for the bloodstains.

00:10:09.589 --> 00:10:12.400
When she doesn’t find any, they talk for
a while.

00:10:12.400 --> 00:10:14.740
It turns out that she already knows who he
is.

00:10:14.740 --> 00:10:18.190
Meanwhile, Chloe is freeing Mary from the
establishment.

00:10:18.190 --> 00:10:22.190
Alan comes to help Henry, but before he can
do anything, Ray shoots him, wounding him

00:10:22.190 --> 00:10:23.360
badly.

00:10:23.360 --> 00:10:26.340
Alan goes invisible before she can do the
same to him.

00:10:26.340 --> 00:10:29.450
She then goes upstairs to see Chloe trying
to free Mary.

00:10:29.450 --> 00:10:33.890
She shoots her, but Allan comes in between
and saves Chloe’s life at the cost of his.

00:10:33.890 --> 00:10:38.030
Agitated, Chloe controls Ray’s mind, and
makes her shoot herself.

00:10:38.030 --> 00:10:40.480
She then says her last goodbye to her grandfather.

00:10:40.480 --> 00:10:45.380
Outside, the police have surrounded the house
after hearing gunshots, while Chloe continues

00:10:45.380 --> 00:10:46.800
saving her mother.

00:10:46.800 --> 00:10:51.040
She controls the guards who are about to capture
Mary, and makes them kill each other.

00:10:51.040 --> 00:10:55.089
She then opens the exit door for Mary and
lets her free, Mary comes outside and flys

00:10:55.089 --> 00:10:56.880
away using her power.

00:10:56.880 --> 00:11:00.230
Chloe falls unconscious, because of the overuse
of her power.

00:11:00.230 --> 00:11:04.490
Meanwhile, a missile then locks itself into
the house, and the wounded Henry uses his

00:11:04.490 --> 00:11:07.300
powers one last time, to slow it down.

00:11:07.300 --> 00:11:11.720
He carries Chloe outside, as the missile hits
the house, burning it behind him.

00:11:11.720 --> 00:11:15.830
When Chloe wakes up, Henry says his last goodbye
and tells her that he loves her.

00:11:15.830 --> 00:11:17.870
Henry dies from his gunshot wound.

00:11:17.870 --> 00:11:21.130
Chloe mourns her father’s death when she
hears gunshots.

00:11:21.130 --> 00:11:24.400
ADF agents are still looking for Chloe, trying
to capture her.

00:11:24.400 --> 00:11:28.380
Suddenly, the shooting stops as Mary arrive
on time to save her.

00:11:28.380 --> 00:11:32.690
Chloe and Mary meet for the first time, and
she promises to hide and protect her forever.

00:11:32.690 --> 00:11:36.580
However, Chloe tells her that they don’t
need to hide anymore, and they can live wherever

00:11:36.580 --> 00:11:37.580
they want.

00:11:37.580 --> 00:11:42.140
Touched by her daughter’s confidence, Mary
flies away with her hands around Chloe.

00:11:42.140 --> 00:11:45.572
